@startuml
title GeoMiniLM Prototype Inference - Dashboard Integration Blocked

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor "Developer / Evaluator" as User

rectangle "GeoMiniLM Candidate\nversioned as code + retrieval data" as Candidate {
  component "Prompt Builder\ninstruction + inputs" as Prompt
  database "TF-IDF Retrieval Checkpoint\ntraining workflow records" as Checkpoint
  component "Nearest-Neighbor Retriever" as Retriever
  component "Handwritten Workflow\nTemplate Fallbacks" as Templates
  component "Prediction Record\nworkflow + explanation + confidence" as Prediction
}

database "Training-Derived Data" as Training
database "Frozen Regression Set\n14 records; no tuning" as Frozen
database "Sealed Shadow Set\nfuture production gate" as Shadow
component "Workflow Evaluator\nworkflow-only scoring" as Evaluator
component "Production Gate Decision" as Gate

cloud "Dashboard GIS / QGIS / ParaView Execution" as Dashboard

User --> Prompt
Training --> Checkpoint
Prompt --> Retriever
Checkpoint --> Retriever
Retriever --> Templates : if no same-id retrieval
Retriever --> Prediction : retrieved workflow
Templates --> Prediction : templated workflow

Prediction --> Evaluator
Frozen --> Evaluator : regression benchmark only
Shadow --> Evaluator : future one-shot acceptance
Evaluator --> Gate

Gate -[#red,dashed]-> Dashboard : blocked until gate passes

note right of Candidate
The prototype is not a generic LLM.
Current predictions combine TF-IDF retrieval
with handwritten templates, so both are part
of the versioned candidate.
end note

note bottom of Dashboard
No runtime GeoMiniLM workflow validator or
direct dashboard execution path is authorized.
end note

@enduml
